# ============================================================
#  .gitignore — WHITELIST
#  Prinsip: abaikan SEMUA file, lalu izinkan hanya kode & template
#  yang jelas aman. File data pelanggan/SF (CSV/XLSX/PKL/DB/ZIP)
#  otomatis TIDAK ikut ter-commit.
# ============================================================

# --- Abaikan semua, tapi tetap telusuri folder (supaya whitelist di subfolder bisa jalan)
*
!*/

# ============================================================
#  BOLEH di-commit: kode, skrip, dokumentasi, & template HTML
# ============================================================
!.gitignore
!*.py
!requirements.txt
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.txt
!*.md
!*.pdf
!resources/performance/SF_Performance_Report_22.html
!resources/geo/GeocodingJatengDIY/index.html
!resources/geo/GeocodingJatengDIY/xlsx.full.min.js

# ============================================================
#  TETAP DILARANG, walau cocok pola whitelist di atas
#  (harus di BAWAH whitelist supaya menimpanya)
# ============================================================

# Rahasia: token bot, password DB, cookie FMC, password dashboard, API key.
# Seluruh rahasia disimpan di .env (yang di-commit hanya .env.example).
config_local.py
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Skrip sementara / sekali pakai
scratch_*

# Folder berisi runtime storage, cache, database SQLite, log, atau sesi browser
/storage/
/build/
/dist/
auth_session/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.claude/
